{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "section2.1" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During this mandatory waiting period, you must maintain a state of total culinary fasting and reflect silently upon the virtues of conservation. You are strictly forbidden from handling or viewing any food preparation materials, and you must not consume even the smallest morsel of sustenance. This temporary detachment ensures your palate and spirit remain entirely unblemished for the trials ahead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.2" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must now dedicate your hours to quiet meditation and the absolute purification of your mind. Do not look upon the platters of others, and strictly avoid entering any space where nourishment is being actively prepared. This interval of complete restraint is vital to steady your focus before the next grand summons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.3" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It is now your duty to enter a phase of strict administrative isolation to clear your thoughts. You must not seek out culinary aromas, nor should you partake in any discussions regarding upcoming menus or banquets. This period of sensory deprivation is designed to reset your appreciation for the bounty of the Great Beyond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.4" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You are required to maintain a serene disposition and keep your physical vessel entirely free from new sustenance. Do not allow your eyes to wander toward the markets, and do not handle any dining utensils until your waiting period officially concludes. This disciplined pause reinforces the boundary between satisfaction and greed within our order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.5" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must immediately enter a state of complete mental stillness and physical fasting to prepare for your next assignment. Do not aggregate any food reserves, and under no circumstances are you permitted to sample any liquids other than pure water. This strict protocol ensures that your next presentation to the High Chancellor will be executed with absolute purity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.6" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must now observe a period of profound quietude, allowing your digestive and mental faculties to achieve perfect rest. You must not participate in any social gatherings centred on dining, and you are strictly forbidden to sample any ingredients. This interval of restriction serves to heighten your respect for the scarcity that defines our world."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.7" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your immediate task is to maintain a serious, contemplative mind and restrict your movements away from the communal kitchens. Do not engage in any lighthearted jests regarding the culinary arts, and do not touch any unblessed provisions during this period. This structured pause is necessary to ground your energy before the next great challenge is unveiled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.8" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must now dedicate your intellect to studying the ancient laws of consumption while maintaining an absolute fast. Do not allow distracting desires to cloud your analytical thoughts, and do not cross the threshold of the grand pantry. This mandatory isolation ensures that your next submission to the Ledger is built upon pristine focus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.9" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You are commanded to observe the natural order of depletion by keeping your own plate empty during this window. Do not attempt to predict or alter the schedule of the upcoming feasts, and do not consume any unauthorised nourishment. This period of enforced stasis prevents chaotic impulses from disrupting your alignment with society."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.10" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must now step away from the fires of preparation and allow your creative culinary thoughts to fall completely silent. Do not adjust any recipes, and do not allow yourself to taste the raw elements of the earth during this administrative interlude. This period of absolute rest allows your palate to return to its baseline of pure neutrality."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.11" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must remain entirely still and avoid any physical exertion that might cause premature cravings. Do not think about snacks, and you must absolutely not hide any food items in your personal quarters. This waiting period is mathematically calibrated to ensure your vessel is perfectly optimised for the next challenge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.12" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must let your thoughts drift away from the material world while maintaining a quiet, unbothered state. Do not try to listen to the whispers of the kitchen sprites, and do not handle any magical or mundane ingredients today. This gentle pause allows your internal energies to realign with the higher frequencies of the Great Beyond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.13" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You are required to log your current status and remain in intellectual contemplation regarding our ancient conservation charts. Do not attempt to map out future provisions, and you must not ingest any sustenance until the high office grants explicit clearance. This period of rigorous internal charting prepares you for the logistical weight of the upcoming trials."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.14" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must consciously slow your internal momentum and commit to a period of absolute stillness. Do not rush through your daily meditations, and under no circumstances consume any food before the scheduled time. This mandated deceleration is essential to ensure you do not exhaust your stamina before the next trial begins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.15" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must accept your current state of completion with absolute gratitude and maintain a silent, respectful fast. Do not ask for more sustenance under any condition, and do not look longingly at the empty bowls of your peers. This period of enforced restraint reinforces the foundational humility required of all members of our culinary society."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.16" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must observe the highest standards of decorum by withdrawing from all public dining chambers to clear your thoughts. Do not write or speak about the culinary habits of the court, and do not allow any forbidden delicacies to enter your sightline. This isolation preserves the absolute integrity of your current administrative standing within our order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section2.17" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must focus your mental energies entirely on the structural laws of our order while maintaining a total fast. Do not attempt to use any shortcuts to ease your hunger, and do not look upon food as a source of emotional comfort during this pause. This period of mental fortification is necessary to prepare you for the psychological weight of the next trial."
