        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must ground yourself in the present moment and allow your physical vessel to experience total, uncompromised rest. Do not let your mind wander to distant feasts, and do not consume any unregulated provisions during this mandatory interval. This temporary pause ensures that your internal baseline remains perfectly aligned with the standards of the Great Beyond."
