          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must now step out of the workspace and allow your hardworking hands to rest completely during this fast. Do not organise the pantries, and you must not handle any raw ingredients until the high office officially opens the next cycle. This boundary between labour and rest is vital for preserving your enduring stamina in our society."
