            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You must channel your unique energies into a state of quiet, grounded introspection to prepare for the future. Do not engage in eccentric dining habits, and do not consume any food items that the high court has not sanctioned. This phase of strict, standardised fasting ensures your vessel remains pure and ready for an administrative audit."
