            "value" : "You must subject your desires to absolute intellectual subjugation and keep your physical vessel entirely vacant. Do not experiment with new methods of nourishment, and do not allow your ambitions to override the strict rules of the fast. This period of absolute compliance is required to temper your spirit against the dangers of excess."
